#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeQuirks.py:204
msgid "evms in use"
msgstr "evms en cours d'utilisation"

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeQuirks.py:205
msgid ""
"Your system uses the 'evms' volume manager in /proc/mounts. The 'evms' "
"software is no longer supported, please switch it off and run the upgrade "
"again when this is done."
msgstr ""
"Votre système utilise le gestionnaire de volumes « evms » dans /proc/mounts. "
"Le logiciel « evms » n'est plus pris en charge, veuillez le désactiver et "
"relancer la mise à niveau."

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeQuirks.py:502
msgid "Your graphics hardware may not be fully supported in Ubuntu 12.04 LTS."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu 12.04 LTS pourrait ne pas prendre entièrement en charge votre carte "
"graphique."

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeQuirks.py:504
msgid ""
"The support in Ubuntu 12.04 LTS for your Intel graphics hardware is limited "
"and you may encounter problems after the upgrade. For more information see "
"https://wiki.ubuntu.com/X/Bugs/UpdateManagerWarningForI8xx Do you want to "
"continue with the upgrade?"
msgstr ""
"La prise en charge du matériel graphique Intel par Ubuntu 12.04 LTS est "
"limitée et vous pourriez rencontrer des problèmes après la mise à niveau. "
"Pour plus d'informations, veuillez consulter https://wiki.ubuntu.com/X/Bugs/"
"UpdateManagerWarningForI8xx. Souhaitez-vous tout de même continuer la mise à "
"niveau ?"

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeQuirks.py:526
#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeQuirks.py:554
#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeQuirks.py:581
msgid ""
"Upgrading may reduce desktop effects, and performance in games and other "
"graphically intensive programs."
msgstr ""
"Le processus de mise à niveau pourrait dégrader les effets du bureau, les "
"performances des jeux et des applications à forte demande graphique."

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeQuirks.py:530
#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeQuirks.py:558
msgid ""
"This computer is currently using the NVIDIA 'nvidia' graphics driver. No "
"version of this driver is available that works with your video card in "
"Ubuntu 10.04 LTS.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Cet ordinateur utilise le pilote de carte graphique « nvidia » de NVIDIA. "
"Aucune version de ce pilote adaptée à votre matériel n'est disponible dans "
"Ubuntu 10.04 LTS.\n"
"\n"
"Voulez-vous continuer ?"

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeQuirks.py:585
msgid ""
"This computer is currently using the AMD 'fglrx' graphics driver. No version "
"of this driver is available that works with your hardware in Ubuntu 10.04 "
"LTS.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Cet ordinateur utilise le pilote de carte graphique « fglrx » d'AMD. Aucune "
"version de ce pilote adaptée à votre matériel n'est disponible dans Ubuntu "
"10.04 LTS.\n"
"\n"
"Voulez-vous continuer ?"

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeQuirks.py:615
msgid "No i686 CPU"
msgstr "Processeur non i686"

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeQuirks.py:616
msgid ""
"Your system uses an i586 CPU or a CPU that does not have the 'cmov' "
"extension. All packages were built with optimizations requiring i686 as the "
"minimal architecture. It is not possible to upgrade your system to a new "
"Ubuntu release with this hardware."
msgstr ""
"Votre système utilise un processeur i586 ou un processeur sans l'extension « "
"cmov ». Tous les paquets optimisés nécessitent au minimum une architecture "
"i686. Une telle configuration matérielle ne peut pas être mise à niveau vers "
"une nouvelle version d'Ubuntu."

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeQuirks.py:652
msgid "No ARMv6 CPU"
msgstr "Pas de processeur ARMv6"

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeQuirks.py:653
msgid ""
"Your system uses an ARM CPU that is older than the ARMv6 architecture. All "
"packages in karmic were built with optimizations requiring ARMv6 as the "
"minimal architecture. It is not possible to upgrade your system to a new "
"Ubuntu release with this hardware."
msgstr ""
"Votre système utilise un processeur ARM antérieur à l'architecture ARMv6. "
"Les optimisations appliquées lors de la construction de tous les paquets "
"dans karmic nécessitent au minimum une architecture de processeur ARMv6. Il "
"est impossible de mettre à niveau votre système vers une nouvelle version "
"d'Ubuntu avec ce matériel."

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeQuirks.py:673
msgid "No init available"
msgstr "Aucun init disponible"

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeQuirks.py:674
msgid ""
"Your system appears to be a virtualised environment without an init daemon, "
"e.g. Linux-VServer. Ubuntu 10.04 LTS cannot function within this type of "
"environment, requiring an update to your virtual machine configuration "
"first.\n"
"\n"
"Are you sure you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Votre système semble s'exécuter dans un environnement virtualisé sans démon "
"init (comme Linux-VServer). Ubuntu 10.04 LTS ne peut pas fonctionner dans un "
"tel environnement, vous devez d'abord mettre à jour la configuration de "
"votre machine virtuelle.\n"
"\n"
"Êtes-vous sûr de vouloir continuer ?"

